        <li><strong>Best for beginners</strong>: Hostinger at $1.99/mo intro — NVMe + hPanel + free domain</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Bottom line</strong>: Match your storage choice to your workload. Don't overspend on NVMe for a static site, but don't cheap out on SATA SSD for a production database. Start with KnownHost for the best spec-to-price ratio on NVMe, or pair a <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-400">RackNerd $1.99 SSD VPS</a> for general compute + a KnownHost NVMe VPS for database workloads.</p>

